From ca48ce3f4caba695d8e9f4675a24ab8a2323a01e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Christopher Owen <3221756+christopherowen@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 11:37:05 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 253/259] CED kernels: one kernel name across the request
 specializations; CED tests in their own file

The single-request and unchanged-row specializations compile as ced_requests,
like the compacting one, so every request launch has one kernel name in traces,
as the indexer's specializations share theirs. The CED kernel tests move from the
metadata tests to tests/kernels/test_deepseek_v41_tilelang_ced.py, named after the
module and its benchmark.
